    current: "PRIMARY=score IC e-CUSUM 단측 붕괴 kill / SECONDARY=Ω drift re-fit"
    change: "★블록5 confidence_hooks 5종 매핑 — (a) crypto_mvrv_mean_reverts: instrument_source 의 FDR_DECISION emit 데이터를 ic_series 로 변환(hit_rate-0.5) 입력 (b) crypto_fgi_contrarian: regime별 contrarian outcome → regime-conditional ic_series (c) crypto_funding_cascade: 이벤트-조건부 hit rate (d) crypto_halving_cycle: phase-conditional Rank-IC (e) crypto_macro_risk_gate: abstain hit-rate. 임계: alpha=0.05, baseline_ic=0.0(또는 regime별 사전등록). regime-conditional 경로는 regime별 별도 e-process 인스턴스"
